## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design offline-first, real-time data flows with conflict resolution in RN apps, including data persistence and user experience during flaky networks.

## Key Concepts
- Offline-first persistence with a local DB (WatermelonDB/SQLite)
- Real-time sync via WebSocket with dedup and sequencing
- Optimistic UI and reconciliation to minimize perceived latency
- Action queues for offline edits and batched syncs
